# Third-party notices

Race Refinery is MIT-licensed (see [LICENSE](LICENSE)). It redistributes
dependencies from crates.io and npm.

## Generating this file

```powershell
npm run gen:notice
```

Or manually:

```powershell
cargo tree -p race-refinery-desktop --prefix none | Sort-Object -Unique
npm ls --all --parseable
```

Maintainers should refresh NOTICE before each tagged release. Exact license texts
for Apache-2.0 / MIT crates are available from crates.io / the package LICENSE files.

## Policy

See `deny.toml` for the allowed license set enforced in CI via `cargo deny`.
